    604  f24e							; LaserWallClamp $F25A (name+pin kept — sim_frame_budget beam_cols keys on
    605  f24e							; the entry; redesign 2026-10-08): CONTACT wall test — tests ONLY the
    606  f24e							; missile TIP cell (one display col x band rows RoomY+2..3) instead of
    607  f24e							; walking the whole swept path. The sweep/phase machine is gone: bank0
    608  f24e							; LaserInput now travels LaserX +/-4px/frame from the eye, capped at the
    609  f24e							; old sweep extent (RoomX+20 / max(RoomX-20,0)) and resets on contact, so
    610  f24e							; there is no path to clamp and CollisionX is never modified (old S6
    611  f24e							; mid-wall tip clamp retired with the sweep).
